    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "__PAPERCLIP_DS_UID__"
      },
      "description": "Agents currently in status='error', split by a bounded error_reason bucket (paperclip_agent_status_error_agents, added in BLO-22498). session_unavailable is the BLO-18012 condition: an agent whose opencode/adapter session did not survive a control-plane restart. other and none are shown for contrast and are NOT that condition -- keeping them visible is the point, because a generic 'agents in error' count cannot tell them apart and would raise a false BLO-18012 alarm on any unrelated failure. Observed live on 2026-09-10: two agents sat in error for 2581s and 594s and NEITHER was session_unavailable (one was BackoffLimitExceeded).\n\nREAD THIS PANEL BACKWARDS FROM THE OTHERS ON THIS DASHBOARD: the exporter publishes every bucket on every pass, including empty ones, so healthy reads as a flat line at 0. An EMPTY panel means the control plane is not reporting -- a fault, not health.\n\nmax by (error_reason), never sum: the gauge is fleet-wide and identical on every replica, so a bare sum would multiply the count by the replica count.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": {
              "legend": false,
              "tooltip": false,
              "viz": false
            },
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": {
              "type": "linear"
            },
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "group": "A",
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "session_unavailable"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
